#: warehouse/templates/manage/organizations.html:286
msgid "Organization Description"
msgstr "Organisationens beskrivning"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/settings.html:96
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organizations.html:291
msgid "Description of your business, product, or project"
msgstr "Beskrivning av ditt företag, din produkt eller ditt projekt"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organizations.html:308
msgid "️Organization Membership Size"
msgstr "️Organisationens medlemsantal"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organizations.html:319
msgid ""
"Estimated number of PyPI Users you anticipate joining this Organization. "
"<b>Not</b> the number of people in your organization."
msgstr ""
"Uppskattat antal PyPI-användare som du tror kommer att ansluta till den här "
"organisationen. <b>Inte</b> antalet personer i din organisation."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organizations.html:327
msgid "Anticipated Usage"
msgstr "Planerad användning"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organizations.html:332
msgid "Description how you plan to use PyPI Organizations features"
msgstr "Beskriv hur du planerar att använda funktionerna i PyPI Organizations"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organizations.html:347
msgid ""
"Tell us a little bit about how you plan to use PyPI Organizations features."
msgstr ""
"Berätta lite om hur du planerar att använda funktionerna i PyPI "
"Organizations."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organizations.html:354
msgid "️Organization Type"
msgstr "️Organisationstyp"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/settings.html:132
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organizations.html:365
msgid ""
"Companies can create organization accounts as a paid service while community"
" projects are granted complimentary access."
msgstr ""
"Företag kan skapa organisationskonton som en betaltjänst medan "
"gemenskapsprojekt får kostnadsfri åtkomst."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organizations.html:377
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You must first enable <a href=\"%(href)s\">two-factor authentication</a> on "
"your account before requesting an organization."
msgstr ""
"Du måste först aktivera <a href=\"%(href)s\">tvåfaktorsautentisering</a> på "
"ditt konto innan du begär en organisation."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organizations.html:386
msgid "Your request(s) for a new PyPI organization(s) have been submitted."
msgstr "Dina begäranden om nya PyPI-organisationer har skickats in."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organizations.html:388
msgid "You will receive an email when each organization has been approved"
msgstr "Du får ett e-postmeddelande när varje organisation har godkänts"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/projects.html:31
#: warehouse/templates/manage/projects.html:22
#: warehouse/templates/manage/team/projects.html:31
msgid "Sole owner"
msgstr "Ensam ägare"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/projects.html:50
#: warehouse/templates/manage/projects.html:41
#: warehouse/templates/manage/team/projects.html:49
msgid "Manage this project"
msgstr "Hantera det här projektet"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/projects.html:55
#: warehouse/templates/manage/projects.html:46
#: warehouse/templates/manage/team/projects.html:54
msgid "You are not an owner of this project"
msgstr "Du är inte ägare till detta projekt"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/projects.html:62
#: warehouse/templates/manage/projects.html:53
#: warehouse/templates/manage/team/projects.html:61
msgid "View this project's public page"
msgstr "Visa projektets offentliga sida"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/projects.html:66
#: warehouse/templates/manage/projects.html:57
#: warehouse/templates/manage/team/projects.html:65
msgid "This project has no releases"
msgstr "Detta projekt har inga utgåvor"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/projects.html:112
msgid "Active Projects"
msgstr "Aktiva projekt"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/projects.html:120
msgid "No active projects."
msgstr "Inga aktiva projekt."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/projects.html:124
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You have not uploaded any projects to PyPI, yet. To learn how to get "
"started, visit the <a href=\"%(href)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">Python Packaging User Guide</a>"
msgstr ""
"Du har inte laddat upp några projekt till PyPI ännu. Läs <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Python Packaging User "
"Guide</a> för att komma igång"
